1
00:00:01,918 --> 00:00:05,088
RAMANI DALBEHERA: We made our Aadhaar cards.

2
00:00:05,088 --> 00:00:06,798
The government asked us to make Adhaar cards.

3
00:00:06,798 --> 00:00:09,718
Why they are asking us? Why?

4
00:00:10,218 --> 00:00:11,136
We didn't know about this before.

5
00:00:11,136 --> 00:00:12,387
It wasn't there earlier.

6
00:00:12,929 --> 00:00:14,681
How do we do it? What do we do?

7
00:00:14,681 --> 00:00:16,224
They call this "Aadhaar card".

8
00:00:16,224 --> 00:00:17,684
How do we do?

9
00:00:18,351 --> 00:00:24,107
We need to get our pictures clicked.

10
00:00:24,566 --> 00:00:26,609
What will they do with this Aadhaar card?

11
00:00:26,901 --> 00:00:28,987
They say that one can get anything...

12
00:00:29,446 --> 00:00:32,991
Rice and anything else with Aadhaar card.

13
00:00:33,491 --> 00:00:37,454
They said...after they said that, after that,...

14
00:00:38,037 --> 00:00:39,414
..they also told about ATM (bank account)...

15
00:00:39,914 --> 00:00:41,708
..asked to get pictures clicked for the ATM.

16
00:00:41,708 --> 00:00:44,586
We old people didn't know about any of these.

17
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:48,465
We don't speak Odia or Hindi, only Sora.

18
00:00:49,257 --> 00:00:53,595
With this, we can receive money and make money.

19
00:00:54,095 --> 00:00:57,098
If we had any money,

20
00:00:57,474 --> 00:01:00,018
if we deposit, government will give us money.

21
00:01:00,518 --> 00:01:02,228
That's good,

22
00:01:02,228 --> 00:01:03,104
but how do we learn about all these?

23
00:01:03,605 --> 00:01:05,940
We don't know what passport --passbok -- means

24
00:01:05,940 --> 00:01:07,233
How do we do all these?

25
00:01:07,859 --> 00:01:09,402
How do we do these? 

26
00:01:09,402 --> 00:01:12,572
We just learnt about this.

27
00:01:13,448 --> 00:01:17,786
Sir, making this Aadhaar card...

28
00:01:19,537 --> 00:01:21,664
now we need to make Aadhaar card.

29
00:01:21,956 --> 00:01:22,874
We learnt now.

30
00:01:23,458 --> 00:01:26,336
Earlier there was nothing...nothing...

31
00:01:27,045 --> 00:01:28,129
..there was nothing...

32
00:01:28,671 --> 00:01:32,509
Then the daily market was in Jartab..only one.

33
00:01:32,759 --> 00:01:35,261
People of Luhangar also came to this daily market.

34
00:01:35,804 --> 00:01:38,306
We hand-carried tamarind

35
00:01:38,306 --> 00:01:40,058
to the market day and night.

36
00:01:40,058 --> 00:01:41,017
Unlike now, Dom people came home

37
00:01:41,309 --> 00:01:43,228
to negotiate for crops.

38
00:01:43,645 --> 00:01:47,148
That's how we carried things to Jartab daily.

39
00:01:47,398 --> 00:01:49,275
We didn't get anything then—

40
00:01:49,275 --> 00:01:52,278
pension money or anything

41
00:01:52,862 --> 00:01:54,739
Now, may be for 3-4 years,

42
00:01:54,739 --> 00:01:57,075
we've started getting old age pension

43
00:01:57,617 --> 00:02:00,745
We didn't get these then.

44
00:02:01,246 --> 00:02:04,082
We only know the land Patta.

45
00:02:04,624 --> 00:02:05,583
That is only in early days.
